  "title": "AsepriteLayer",
  "description": "A single layer entry in the Aseprite JSON metadata (`meta.layers`). Only `name` is guaranteed. `opacity` and `blendMode` describe an image layer's compositing and can both be absent (a group layer has neither), and `color`/`data` carry the layer's editor user data when it was set. `group` names the enclosing group layer and is absent at the top level, so the flat array encodes the layer tree by parent name.",
